# Auto-detect text files and normalize line endings to LF in the repo. AU
# runs on a Windows runner and the backfill PR-back step copies its CRLF
# output into the working tree; without this normalization, every PR-back
# commit appears to rewrite every line of every touched file.
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Binary file types that should never be touched.
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
*.ttf           binary
*.otf           binary
*.woff          binary
*.woff2         binary
*.zip           binary
*.7z            binary
*.exe           binary
*.dll           binary
*.msi           binary
*.nupkg         binary
*.pdf           binary
